# Responsive/theme/accessibility

Dark is primary; light is an equivalent theme using the same geometry. Use semantic tokens only.

Test representative viewports: 320x568, 375x667, 390x844, 768x1024, 1024x768, 1280x800, 1440x900, 1920x1080.

Tablet is a true reflow, not scaled desktop. Mobile has no desktop sidebar and uses safe-area/dvh/keyboard-aware layout.

Coarse pointer targets >=44px. No hover-only critical action. Preserve keyboard navigation, focus-visible, labels and adequate contrast. No accidental document horizontal overflow.
